SUMMARY:In The Other Room: David Jolly
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:David Jolly is an American stand-up comedian known for his raw\
 , fearless humor and magnetic stage presence. Hailing from Florida\, Jolly 
 has become a rising star in the national comedy scene\, captivating audienc
 es with his unfiltered storytelling and sharp wit.\n\nJolly gained widespre
 ad recognition through his appearances on the popular “Kill Tony” podca
 st\, where his bold comedic style and authentic personality resonated with 
 fans. He has since performed at major comedy venues across the country\, in
 cluding the Pittsburgh Improv.\n\nBeyond the stage\, Jolly is open about hi
 s personal journey\, including his commitment to sobriety\, which he discus
 ses candidly in interviews and on social media . He often refers to himself
  as “America’s Favorite Uncle\,” a persona that reflects his warm\, r
 elatable approach to comedy. Jolly maintains an active presence on Instagra
 m ([handle removed])\, where he shares tour updates\, behind-the-scenes con
 tent\, and engages with his growing fanbase.\n\nThere is a two-item per per
 son minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any food or drink
  items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar 
 and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserve
 s the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem d
 isruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.ap
 p/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-other-room-david-jolly-21914/
